    <li>Registrations made with incorrect or incomplete information may be reviewed by the organizer.</li>
    <li>Submission or payment processes after registration may vary depending on the congress workflow.</li>
</ul>

<p>
AntAbstract supports the technical execution of registration conditions determined by congress organizers.
Congress content, scientific programs, registration rules and participation conditions may be the responsibility of the relevant organizer.
</p>"
