<p>
Reviewers are responsible for evaluating assigned submissions objectively, in accordance with academic ethics and confidentiality principles.
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Reviewers should only access submissions assigned to them.</li>
    <li>Review comments and recommendations must be kept confidential.</li>
    <li>If there is a conflict of interest, the organizer or authorized person should be notified.</li>
    <li>Review evaluations should be scientific and constructive.</li>
    <li>Submission files should not be shared with unauthorized persons.</li>
</ul>

<p>
Final decisions such as acceptance, rejection, revision or presentation type may be made by the scientific committee,
editors or authorized congress organization team.
</p>"
        ));

