</p>

<ul>
    <li>The payment screen may be opened after registration or after submission acceptance depending on the congress workflow.</li>
    <li>Payment transactions may be carried out through third-party payment providers.</li>
    <li>Billing information must be entered accurately by the user.</li>
    <li>Refund and cancellation conditions are subject to the rules determined by the congress organizer.</li>
    <li>After payment is completed, payment history and related records may be displayed in the system.</li>
